+ * and one L2 page per GiB, plus a possible boundary-straddling page.
+ * TTBR0 additionally starts at L0; reserve that root in the same budget.
+ * This is a page-table capacity, not a promise of host RAM availability.
  */
-#define BOOTSTRAP_TABLE_SIZE (ARM_PGBYTES * 16)
